  "description": "DNG Lettings present this modern, A-rated four-bedroom red-brick mid-terrace home is presented in excellent condition and ideally located directly opposite the 54-acre Father Collins Park in the heart of Clongriffin. \n\nBuilt to a high standard, the property offers spacious, light-filled accommodation across three floors. The ground floor features an entrance hall, a bright double bedroom, a guest W\\.C., a utility room, and a large open-plan kitchen/dining area with double doors leading to a private rear garden. The first floor comprises a light filled and spacious living room, a generously sized double bedroom and a landing with storage, while the top floor includes a stylish bathroom and two additional bedrooms, including a master suite with en suite bathroom. \n\nAdditional features include decorative timber flooring, integrated kitchen appliances, off-street parking, and excellent energy efficiency throughout. Located within a lovley estate, the home is just a short walk to Clongriffin DART station, with convenient access to local schools, shops, cafés, Dublin Airport, and the M1/M50 motorways.",
